Package: SVDMx
Title: Child/Child-Adult Mortality-Indexed Model Life Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Samuel", "Clark", , "work@samclark.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: SVD-Comp mortality model indexed by either child or child/adult mortality. 
    Given input value(s) of either 5q0 or (5q0, 45q15), the qx() function generates 
    single-year 1qx or 5-year 5qx age-specific probabilities of dying. 
    See <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1612.01408> and <doi:10.1007/s13524-019-00785-3>. 
